<title>USA: Just for Feet Q4 same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Just for Feet Q4 same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Just for Feet Inc said on Monday fourth quarter sales rose 105.4 percent to $79,039,000 copmared to last year's sales of $38,478,000, with same-store sales rising 16.3 percent.</p>
<p>For the year ending January 31, 1997, sales were $256,307,000, up 113.9 percent over last year. For the entire year ended January 31, 1997 comparable store sales increased 24.7 percent, the company said.</p>
